function systemParentLabel(){if(view==='settings'&&settingsPage!=='menu')return ['permissions','sorting'].indexOf(settingsPage)>=0?'桌面与常驻':'设置';if(view==='workshop'&&workshop.page!=='input')return '工作坊';return '桌面';}
function installSystemNavigation(){var heading=main.querySelector('.page-heading'),back=document.createElement('button'),label=systemParentLabel();back.id='atom-app-back';back.setAttribute('aria-label','返回'+label);back.innerHTML='<svg viewBox="0 0 16 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3L3 12l9 9"/></svg><span>'+esc(label)+'</span>';back.onclick=joystickBack;if(heading){heading.classList.add('atom-navigation-header');var legacy=heading.querySelector('[data-settings-page="menu"],[data-workshop-page="input"]');if(legacy)legacy.remove();heading.prepend(back);}else{back.className='atom-navigation-floating';main.appendChild(back);}}
function settingsHeading(title){return '<div class="page-heading"><h1>'+title+'</h1></div>';}
